    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Initial concentration</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;at equilibrium<br />Let total pressure be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>Using dalton&#39;s law of partial pressures and equation for equilibrium constant:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvaria